OL,3,GNEWSAPair sentenced for human
OL,4,Atrafficking crimes
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been sentenced for a
OL,7,Fseries of offences including human
OL,8,Ftrafficking.
OL,10,FGerald Corrigan, 66, with an address of
OL,11,FKeeragh Park, Pomeroy, previously
OL,12,Fpleaded guilty to human trafficking,
OL,13,Fpossessing criminal property and
OL,14,Ftransferring criminal property.
OL,16,FMavie Martins Mariano 51, with an
OL,17,Faddress of Ard Aveen Park, Bessbrook,
OL,18,Fpreviously pleaded guilty to human
OL,19,Ftrafficking, acquiring criminal
OL,20,Fproperty, possessing criminal property,
OL,21,Ftransferring criminal property, brothel
OL,22,Fkeeping and controlling prostitution.
